{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48810","headline":"同韩给事观毕给事画松石 · 皇甫冉","name":"同韩给事观毕给事画松石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海峤微茫那得到，楚关迢递心空忆。\n夕郎善画岩间松，远意幽姿此何极。\n千条万叶纷异状，虎伏螭盘争劲力。\n扶疎半映晚天青，凝澹全和曙云黑。\n烟笼月照安可道，雨湿风吹未曾息。\n能将积雪辨晴光，每与连峰作寒色。\n龙楼不竞繁花吐，骑省偏宜遥夜直。\n罗浮道士访移来，少室山僧旧应识。\n掖垣深沈昼无事，终日亭亭在人侧。\n古槐衰柳宁足论，还对罘罳列行植。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}